# Data files
# NOTE: data/ holds scraped papers, generated briefings, release artifacts,
# DB backups and USER UPLOADED images (incl. medical photos — L3 private data).
# NEVER commit new data content. The whole tree is ignored; already-tracked
# files (e.g. reference_ranges.json, *.gitkeep) remain tracked regardless.
# See AGENTS.md "User Privacy & Data Security".
data/

